# The api image builds from the repository root (it needs web/ as well as backend/), so this file keeps
# the build context small and keeps machine-local state out of the image.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded: web/public/map-template.json. It is small, it is committed, and the api
# stage's Node build regenerates it anyway — excluding it would make the api build depend on an
# assumption ("nothing reads the committed copy") for no measurable gain. A build that fails over a
# 25 kB file is not worth the tokens saved.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/target
**/.build
*.log
.dev
.env
.env.*
